+    /// A commit the system cannot honour leaves the page lazy – the next access retries it –
+    /// and records the failure so a crash on that page reads as out of memory (#467). A freed
+    /// address stands in for a commit refused near the commit limit: `VirtualAlloc(MEM_COMMIT)`
